Privacy Policy
Introduction
This Privacy Policy applies to the app “BMI Calculator”, developed by Aqeel Alansari (the developer listed on the Google Play Store).

Our Privacy Policy will help you understand what information we collect at BMI Calculator, how BMI Calculator uses it, and what choices you have.

BMI Calculator was built by Aqeel Alansari as a free app. This Service is provided by Aqeel Alansari at no cost and is intended for use as is.

If you choose to use our Service, then you agree to the collection and use of information in relation to this policy. The personal information that we collect is used for providing and improving the Service. We will not use or share your information with anyone except as described in this Privacy Policy.

The terms used in this Privacy Policy have the same meanings as in our Terms and Conditions, unless otherwise defined here.
